abstract: "Exploratory documentary reconstructibility audit of a fixed historical corpus. Author-owned code is MIT licensed; original coding and documentation are CC BY 4.0. Supporting revision v1.3.0 adds a source-limited positive-only human-reassessment sensitivity; 20 of 57 historical complete positions remained complete and original-source verification of the other 37 remains pending. Historical primary results remain unchanged. No clinical treatment-effect analysis is performed."
